1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,280
Forget the past.

2
00:00:01,920 --> 00:00:03,280
But remember the lesson.

3
00:00:04,420 --> 00:00:06,140
Let go of what hurts you.

4
00:00:07,040 --> 00:00:09,040
But never forget what it taught you.

5
00:00:10,220 --> 00:00:11,980
Not every loss is a failure.

6
00:00:12,960 --> 00:00:14,340
Some are just directions.

7
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:16,220
Learn from it.

8
00:00:17,040 --> 00:00:18,480
But don't let it define you.
